{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Each according to the gift of his hand.</b> Not that he should give everything he has and himself come to need the support of others — as is the thinking of foolish simpletons, as they said, may their memory be for blessing (Ketubot 50a): הַמְבַזְבֵּז אַל יְבַזְבֵּז יוֹתֵר מֵחֹמֶשׁ (\"One who squanders should not squander more than a fifth\")."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:21:35.705925952Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}